// Axiom Compiler — MIR Constant Folding Pass (compiler/opt/const_fold.ax)
// Port of constant folding from bootstrap/axiom0/src/opt/opt.c (`-O1` pass 1), extended with
// 128-bit integer folding, `IntToInt` cast folding, mixed-width shift folding, and local constant
// propagation across expanded bit/wrapping/saturating intrinsic temporaries (T452, T484).
//
// Checked arithmetic operations that would overflow, divide by zero, or shift out of range are
// intentionally left unfolded so runtime trap semantics (`assert(!overflows(...))`) are preserved.
module compiler.opt.const_fold

